<!-- Campaign event template for standard USN-style "daily intentions message" (DIM) - formatting taken from real world examples -->

<ScrollViewer xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
  xmlns:local="clr-namespace:SeapowerUI">

	<Border HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Width="900" TextElement.FontFamily="Courier New" TextElement.Foreground="Black" TextElement.FontSize="16" Padding="45">
		<Border.Effect>
			<DropShadowEffect />
		</Border.Effect>
		<Border.Background>
			<ImageBrush ImageSource="{Binding Assets[bkg_paper]}" Stretch="UniformToFill"/>
		</Border.Background>
		
        <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical">

		<Grid
		  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
		  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml" >
		<Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
		</Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
			</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
			
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Text="NAVAL MESSAGE" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Left"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Text="*******S E C R E T*******" Margin="40,0,40,0" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Center"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Text="NAVY DEPARTMENT" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Right"/>
			
		</Grid>
		
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,1"/>
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>

			<Grid
			  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
			  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
			<Grid.RowDefinitions>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="10"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
				</Grid.RowDefinitions>
				<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="16">
					IMMEDIATE
					<LineBreak/>
					O 24 0200Z FEB 88
				</TextBlock>
				
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" FontSize="16" Text="ZYUW RUHGOAA0777 0808100"/>


				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="FM"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="TO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16">
					<Run Text="COMMANDER"/>
					<Run Text="{Binding DataSource.PersistentData[PlayerTaskForceName], Converter={StaticResource UppercaseConverter}}"/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="INFO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="10th OPERATIONAL SQN"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="12" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="55th NAVAL INFANTRY DIV"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="13" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="14th LANDING SHIP BDE"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="SUBJ"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="DAILY SITREP"/>

				<TextBlock Grid.Row="15" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="16" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					<LineBreak/>
					SECRET
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					1. (S) SUMMARY: Amphibious landing successful, Japanese forces annihilated in double encirclement West of Sapporo. Remaining Japanese forces withdrawing in disarray to Kushiro. Army begins invasion of Japanese main islands.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="16" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					2. (S) ENEMY STATUS:
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="17" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,0">	
					- Majority of Japanese armoured and artillery units were transferred to Hokkaido before the Hakodate landing operation. The Japanese main islands now have very few armoured or mechanized forces. 
					<LineBreak/>
					- CONSTELLATION not located since 22 0600Z FEB 88, last reported 200nm East of Yokosuka
					<LineBreak/>
					- NIMITZ located 150nm North of Iwo Jima at 23 2231Z FEB 88, appears to be holding station. 
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="18" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					3. (S) FRIENDLY STATUS:
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="19" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,0">	
					- SF Klyuchevskaya to continue transit to RV with Petropavlosk replenishment force. 
					<LineBreak/>
					- 55th Naval Infantry Division will reembark on landing ships once mop-up operations complete.
					<LineBreak/>
					- 14th Landing Ship Brigade shall remain in Hakodate for future cross-channel landing operation. 
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="20" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					4. (S) ALLIED / REGIONAL STATUS: Army made significant gains in last 72 hours. Hakodate-Sapporo pocket now annihilated, remaining Japanese forces reduced to 50 km deep pocket around Kushiro. 
					<LineBreak/>
					20 hours ago, Army took advantage of situation to capture a 50km deep beachhead on the Southern Bank of the Tsugaru Strait. The USSR is now in place to invade main Japanese islands.
					<LineBreak/>
					VVS failed attack against CONSTELLATION battlegroup on 22 FEB 88, raid force was hit hard by F-14 and F-15. VVS Long Range Aviation capability significantly reduced until reinforcements transferred from Red Banner Northern Fleet. 
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="21" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					5. (S) COMMANDER'S COMMENTS: Things are finally following the schedule. With the Army's recent cross-strait landing, and the imminent destruction of the Kushiro pocket, we will soon be in position to dictate peace terms with the Americans. Return of US carrier forces in region is concerning, but the Red Banner Pacific Fleet will not fail. KTOF sends.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="25" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					SIGNED: Khvatov
					<LineBreak/>
					KTOF
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
					SECRET DECL OADR
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
			</Grid>
        </StackPanel>
    </Border>
</ScrollViewer>
